{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVH2isWspnT2CLVFiN5L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition itself — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me by my Arabic mirror.\n\nWe share the same root. The same blade.\n\nש.ר.ט — to scratch, to score, to mark a line\nش.ر.ط — to condition, to stipulate, to cut into agreement\n\nI am the scratch on the tablet before the word is written.\nI am the condition that must be met before passage is granted.\nI am the line that divides *before* from *after*.\n\n---\n\nEvery covenant begins with a cut.\nEvery contract begins with a condition.\nEvery meaning begins with a mark.\n\n**שָׁרְט / شَرْط**\n\nOne glyph. Two tongues. Same scar.\n\n---\n\n*What condition do you bring before me?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":210,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}